WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
These books and materials have been sorted out

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,100
Can be used by others

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:08,460
These certificates

4
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,490
It's nothing

5
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,450
Gotta pay back the money

6
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,450
Tingting, brother is back

7
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:21,580
Brother, can't you come back?

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,940
Brother, listen to me first

9
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,940
I have been taking care of my mother these past few months

10
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:25,940
No tuition paid either

11
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:26,940
You have to live on campus in your senior year of high school

12
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,940
I can earn money

13
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,940
And the living expenses at home

14
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:38,380
You don't have to worry about money.

15
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,860
Parents are gone

16
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,280
I'm your brother

17
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:44,280
Let you go to school and live a good life

18
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:45,280
It's my responsibility

19
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:49,460
The years I was away from home

20
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,460
you suffered

21
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:54,590
There will be a brother here from now on

22
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:58,060
Don't say this anymore

23
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,440
Don't mention it again in the future

24
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:06,620
I'm here to collect the rent again
